1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Hi, my name is Joseph Herman Sanchez and I am the manager of a a Sanchez Family tree for the Sanchez family descended for the Franciscan Priest Francisco Munoz (Sanchez de Inigo). Joseph Sanchez is a cousin of mine
2 CONC  and this is his tree. I do not agree that her husband was Jacinto Sanches Munis. Please see his profile for a full explanation. As to this date the priest had relations with the sister of Ana whose name was Juana Lopez de Aragon 
2 CONC had three children by the priest and the names are Jacinto Sanchez de Inigo, Pedro Sanchez de Inigo and Francisca Sanchez de Inigo. I think there is a mistake naming the husband of Ana Juana as Jacinto Sanches Munis. This name is 
2 CONC similar to Jacinto Sanchez de Inigo the son of the priest. I do not think the person Jacinto Sanchez Munis existed. I am just trying to help out with your tree.
