1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''Maria Antonia Montoya''', born 1682 in New Mexico; died August 22, 1750 in Santa Fe, New Mexico. 
2 CONT
2 CONT She was the daughter of Antonio Montoya and Maria Hurtado. 
2 CONT
2 CONT She appeared on the Don Diego de Vargas census 22 Dec 1692 to 2 Jan 1693 in El Paso del Norte, Nuevo Méjico. Nueva España.
2 CONT
