2 CONT
2 CONT Maria married first Alonso Romero.  After his death she married Diego Arias de Quiróz on 28 July 1714 in San Ildefonso, Santa Fe County, New Mexico. She was again a widow in 1738 when she sold a house and land contiguous to the ea
2 CONC st tower of the Governor’s Palace. [p. 235, Vol. I of the Spanish Archives of New Mexico, Archive #235]
