2 CONT Fourth household, three sons, three daughters, two servants
2 CONT
2 CONT Diego Montoya, regidor, married to Josefa de Hinojos, with six children: '''Salvador''', three; Juan Estevan, five; Antonio, three; Maria de la Rosa, eight; Luisa, four; Juana, two.  Likewise, this household has two married servan
2 CONC ts named Antonio and his wife, Ana Duran.  He states that, as a loyal vassal of his majesty, he is quite ready to enter to settle with his wife and children when I, the governor and captain general, enter.
2 CONT
2 CONT To The Royal Crown Restored, pg. 39
2 CONT
2 CONT == Notes ==
2 CONT
