2 CONT Miguel de San Juan was the illegitimate son of Juana Baca, also known as "La Vieja" and an unknown father.  A short biography is found on the first three pages of the document.  On page 15:  "on 25 April 1732 ... appeared Doña Ysa
2 CONC bel Montoya, widow of the standard bearer Miguel de San Juan."
