2 CONT Married:
2 CONT #[http://www.geni.com/people/Captain-Juan-Garci-de-Noriega-alguacil-mayor-de-el-cabildo/5483325185970073190?through=6000000001660297863 Juan Garcia de Noriega]
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Dona Francisca Sánches de Iñigo and Juan Garcia de Noriega:
2 CONT #[http://www.geni.com/people/Juan-Garcia/6000000005024521480 Juan Antonio Garcia]
2 CONT #[http://www.geni.com/people/Francisco-Garcia/6000000005024521486?through=6000000005024521480 Francisco Garcia]
2 CONT #[http://www.geni.com/people/Jose-Garcia/6000000005024521492?through=6000000005024521486 Jose Garcia]
2 CONT #[http://www.geni.com/people/Maria-Garcia/6000000005024521469?through=6000000005024521492 Maria Garcia]
2 CONT
2 CONT Francisca Sanchez de Inigo is the daughter of... 
2 CONT
2 CONT == Biography ==
2 CONT
2 CONT She appeared on the Don Diego de Vargas census 22 Dec 1692 to 2 Jan 1693 in El Paso del Norte, Nuevo Méjico. Nueva España.
2 CONT
2 CONT Second household, three sons, one daughter, eight servants
2 CONT
2 CONT Capt. Juan Garcia de Noriega, alguacil mayor of the cabildo, married to Francisca Sanchez de Inigo, with three sons and one daughter: Juan Antonio, eleven; Francisco, seven; Jose, five; Maria, two.  Likewise, in this household are
2 CONC  the following people in his service: Juana, eighteen; Luis; Luisa, twenty; Gertrudis, seven; Bernardino, four; Maria, five; Monica, five; Alonso, three; Mateo, one; Antonio, nine.
2 CONT
2 CONT To The Royal Crown Restored, pg. 37
2 CONT
2 CONT == Notes ==
2 CONT
2 CONT Kessell, John L. and Hendricks, Rick, editors, To The Crown Restored, The Journals of Don Diego de Vargas, New Mexico, 1692-1694, University of New Mexico Press. 1995, ISBN 0-8263-1559-3
