1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''Francisco Martin Serrano'''
2 CONT
2 CONT He appeared on the Don Diego de Vargas census 22 Dec 1692 to 2 Jan 1693 in El Paso del Norte, Nuevo México, Nueva España.
2 CONT
2 CONT Twelfth household, three sons, five daughters
2 CONT
2 CONT Capt. Luis Martin, married to Melchora de los Reyes, with three sons and, likewise, daughters named '''Francisco Martin''', twenty; Manuel, nine; Sebastian, six; Sebastiana, twenty; Catalina, fifteen; Maria de la Rosa, twelve; Cat
2 CONC alina, nine; and Polonia, three.  He says that, as a loyal vassal of his majesty, he is ready to enter immediately, as soon as I, the governor and captain general, enter to settle this kingdom.
2 CONT
2 CONT To The Royal Crown Restored, pg. 41
