1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''Vicente de Luna''' born September 1750, Los Padillas, Nuevo Méjico, Nueva España, died before September 1782
2 CONT
2 CONT == Baptismal record ==
2 CONT
2 CONT Vicente de Luna, Spanish, baptized 21 Sep 1750; son of Domingo de Luna & Doña Josepha Luzero; Padrinos: Don José Reaño and Doña Anna Maria Ortiz.
2 CONT
2 CONT ~New Mexico Marriages and Baptisms San Augustin de la Isleta Church, pg. 129
2 CONT
2 CONT == Marriage record ==
2 CONT
2 CONT Vicente married María Victoria Durán y Cháves, daughter of Vicente Durán y Cháves and María Gertrudis Sánches, on 30 Jan 1774 in San Augustín de la Isleta, Isleta, Nueva Méjico, Nueva España. (María Victoria Durán y Cháves was bor
2 CONC n in Aug 1757 in Los Padillas, Nuevo Méjico, Nueva España and was christened on 10 Aug 1757 in San Augustín de la Isleta, Isleta, Nueva Méjico, Nueva España)
2 CONT
2 CONT ~New Mexico Marriages and Baptisms San Augustin de la Isleta Church, pg. 19 
