1 NOTE {geni:about_me} === GEDCOM Note ===
2 CONT Manuel Quintana, md. Feliciana Medina, daughter of Isidro Medina, known children
2 CONT
2 CONT Feliciana Medina and her sister Candelaria Medina were identified as daughter of Ysidro Medina in a prenuptial investigation of Pedro Alcantara Vigil (son of antonio Jose Vigil and Maria Josefa Tafoya) and Maria Josefa Quintana (d
2 CONC aughter of Ignacio Quintana and Getrudis de Herrera). This couple was related in the third and fourth degree of consanguinity, requiring dispensation from the bishop of Durango. AHAD-374, fr 657-669 (23 Nov 1821-15, Jan 1822 Santa
2 CONC  Cruz). The lineges given in this record is as follows: Ysidora Medina (father) Feliciana Medina                            1st degree                          Candelaria Medina Ignacio Quintana                             2nd deg
2 CONC ree                        Juan Bautista Vigil Maria Josefa Quintana                    3rd degree                         Antonio Jose Vigil 4th degree                         Pedro Alcantara Vigil
2 CONT
2 CONT === GEDCOM Note ===
