1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''María Victoria Durán y Chávez''' born Aug 1757, Los Padillas, Nuevo Méjico, Nueva España
2 CONT
2 CONT == Baptismal record ==
2 CONT
2 CONT María Victoria Cháves, baptized 10 Aug 1757, daughter of Vicente Cháves & Getrudes Sánches; Padrinos: Joseph Gallego & Juana Cháves.
2 CONT
2 CONT ~New Mexico Marriages and Baptisms San Augustin de la Isleta Church, pg. 147
2 CONT
2 CONT == Marriage record ==
2 CONT
2 CONT María married Vicente de Luna, son of Domingo de Luna and Josefa Lucero, on 30 Jan 1774 in San Augustín de la Isleta, Isleta, Nueva Méjico, Nueva España. (Vicente de Luna was born in Sep 1750 in Los Padillas, Nuevo Méjico, Nueva E
2 CONC spaña, christened on 21 Sep 1750 in San Augustín de la Isleta, Isleta, Nueva Méjico, Nueva España and died before Sep 1782.)
2 CONT
2 CONT ~New Mexico Marriages and Baptisms San Augustin de la Isleta Church, pg. 19
