1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''Augustin Manuel de Luna''' born 1779
2 CONT
2 CONT == Marriage Record ==
2 CONT
2 CONT 10 Apr 1803 DMs, 17 Apr 1803, Augustín Manuel de Luna, Spanish 24, son of Vicente de Luna, deceased, and Maria Victoria Chaves of the Second Plaza de los Chaves, married Maria Guadalupe Chaves, Spanish, 26, daughter of Miguel Anto
2 CONC nio Chaves and Josefa Antonia Baca, deceased. Padrinos: Jose Antonio Chaves and his sister Catharina Chaves, all of Puesto de Los Chaves. Tests: Toribio Garía Jurado of Los Garcías, Pedro Padilla of the Plaza de Sausal, José Garcí
2 CONC a Jurado of the Plaza de Los Bacas. Witnesses: Juan José Gallego, José Sánches, Nicolas Cháves, all three of Puesto de Los Cháves.
2 CONT
2 CONT ~Tomé Marriages, pg. 33
