1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Ben M. Angel notes: The connection here between Jose Eusebio Ruibal and Maria Eulogia, his daughter, seems to be proved through her brother, Ferdinand. Ferdinand, who married Juana Maria Romero, daughter of Ramon R
2 CONC omero and Maria Micaela Lopes, is listed on marriage records containing the same parental names as those of Eulogia's parents, and yet are listed in the Hispanic Genealogical Research Center of New Mexico's Great New Mexico Pedigr
2 CONC ee Database without Eulogia. Additionally, the name Martinez has been shortened to Martin in HGRC's resource. 
2 CONT
2 CONT The name variation is not unusual for those descending from the original Martin Serrano lineage, which began with a blacksmith attached to Cortes' expedition of conquest of Mexico. Indeed, if this part of the Great New Mexico Pedi
2 CONC gree Database is correct, this is one of the first documented surname variations going from Martin to Martinez that I've been able to find in my family's ancestry. Again, the Martin in Martin Serrano was prefixed to Serrano, Herna
2 CONC n's original last name, in honor of the conquistador, whose father's first name was Martin.
2 CONT
2 CONT References:
2 CONT
2 CONT "New Mexico, Marriages, 1751-1918," index, FamilySearch (https://familysearch.org/pal:/MM9.1.1/FDP5-754 : accessed 24 Feb 2013), Maria Paubla Martines in entry for Santos Rodrigues and Eulogia Ruibal, 07 Sep 1849; citing reference
2 CONC  2:Z1BN4J, FHL microfilm 16982.
2 CONT
2 CONT "New Mexico, Marriages, 1751-1918," index, FamilySearch (https://familysearch.org/pal:/MM9.1.1/FDPP-M6N : accessed 24 Feb 2013), Paubla Martines in entry for Fernando Ruibal and Juana Maria Romero, 17 Nov 1849; citing reference 2:
2 CONC Z1BNKR, FHL microfilm 16982.
2 CONT
2 CONT ---
2 CONT
2 CONT From the Hispanic Genealogical Research Center of New Mexico's Great New Mexico Pedigree Database:
2 CONT
2 CONT http://www.hgrc-nm.org/surnames/GNMPD.html/d0133/g0013351.html#I44443
2 CONT
2 CONT Jose Eusebio ROYBAL
2 CONT *Father: Santiago Jose de ROYBAL 
2 CONT *Mother: Maria Candelaria BENAVIDES 
2 CONT
2 CONT Family 1 : Maria Paula MARTIN
2 CONT *1. +Fernando ROYBAL
2 CONT **married Juana Maria Romero (children Aug. 1850-1870 in Embudo) and Maria Lucero (b. c1826, child Apr. 1850 in Embudo, chronology conflict)
2 CONT *2. +Ygnacio ROYBAL, b. c1820
2 CONT **married Maria Manuela Martin c1840 (b. 1824, children 1841-1859 in Embudo)
2 CONT *3. +Jose Tomas Nicomedio ROYBAL, b. Sept. 1823
2 CONT **married Maria de la Luz Lucero (b. Sept. 1830, children 1848 in Embudo to 1859 in La Costilla)
2 CONT *4. Maria Juana ROYBAL, b. Jan. 1825 in Embudo
2 CONT *5. Jose Elmeterio ROYBAL, b. March 1835 in Embudo
2 CONT *6. Maria Juliana ROYBAL, b. Jan. 1837 in Embudo
2 CONT *7. Maria Eugenia ROYBAL, b. Jan 1839 in Embudo
2 CONT *8. Maria Manuela ROYBAL, b. Jan. 1841 in Embudo
2 CONT *9. Jose Miguel ROYBAL, b. Apr. 1846 in Embudo
2 CONT
2 CONT No citations given.
