1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Information by Joseph H. Sanchez, 2nd great grandson.
2 CONT
2 CONT Beatriz was the second wife of Jesus and she was the sister of Maria his first wife. She had five children with Jesus and Maria had two children.
2 CONT
2 CONT I would like to thank my cousin Tina Perez (Sanchez) daughter of Salomon Sanchez, my grandfather's brother for providing this photo. My aunt Alicia had given me a 8x10 copy of this but I lost in some time ago. Tina did not know wh
2 CONC o this was and was surprised when I told her who it was. She said she had a photo of an old Indian woman and did not know who it was. It was given to her by my aunt Mamie, the brother of Salomon. She aso gave me a copy of the wedd
2 CONC ing photo and family photo of my great grandparents, Ubaldo and Rosela Sanchez.
