1 NOTE {geni:about_me} At the age of 13, Joaquin listed in the military (Spain) as a drummer in Santa Fe on March 1, 1801. He was listed on an invalid roaster on October 21, 1821 (Mexico has achieved independence from Mexico on September
2 CONC  27, 1821). 
2 CONT
2 CONT At the time of enlistment he was recorded to be 4 feet tall, and had light chestnut hair and eyebrows, dark eyes, and a aquiline nose. 
