1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''Antonio Jose Luna''' was born in 1808 and is sometimes referred to as the father of Los Lunas. He became a civic and political leader and married Isabella Baca, daughter of a prominent family from Belen, a commu
2 CONC nity ten miles south of Los Lunas.
