2 CONT
2 CONT * 	Household	Gender	Age	Birthplace
2 CONT *self	 Reyes Valdez	M	26	 New Mexico, United States (est. b. 1854)
2 CONT *wife	Alvina Valdez	F	24	 New Mexico, United States (est. b. 1856)
2 CONT *son	Roman Valdez	M	3	 New Mexico, United States (est. b. 1877, actually b. 1878)
2 CONT
2 CONT "United States Census, 1880," index and images, FamilySearch (https://familysearch.org/pal:/MM9.1.1/MZTV-Y6Y : accessed 10 Feb 2013), Reyes Valdez, Rio Arriba, Rio Arriba, New Mexico, United States; citing sheet 121C, family 0, NA
2 CONC RA microfilm publication T9-0803.
2 CONT
2 CONT Reyes' parents were supposed to have died when he was young, and he was adopted by a Valdez family, thereby taking on the Valdez name rather than Chaves name.
2 CONT
2 CONT ---
2 CONT
2 CONT Reyes Valdez, "United States Census, 1900"
2 CONT *name:	 Reyes Valdez
