2 CONT *wife	Cipriana Roybal	F	28y	 New Mexico (est. b. 1892, actually b. 1891)
2 CONT *dau	Amada Raybal	F	3y5m	 New Mexico (est. b. 1916)
2 CONT *dau	Rufina Raybal	F	2y2m	 New Mexico (est. b. 1917)
2 CONT *Reyes Valdez	M	66y	 New Mexico (est. b. 1854, actually b. 1859)
2 CONT
2 CONT "United States Census, 1920," index and images, FamilySearch (https://familysearch.org/pal:/MM9.1.1/M4K9-M6V : accessed 10 Feb 2013), Reyes Valdez in household of Victoriano Roybal, , Rio Arriba, New Mexico; citing enumeration dis
2 CONC trict (ED) , sheet 11A, family 44, NARA microfilm publication T625, FHL microfilm 1821078.
2 CONT
2 CONT Doesn't appear in the 1930 census, when Victoriano and Cipriana have relocated to Alamosa, Colorado. (The Reyes Valdez buried at this city's municipal cemeter is not likely to be him, as he was b. 1895, d. 1962.) A grandchild name
2 CONC d after him was born in the census year, but not counted in that enumeration.
2 CONT
