2 CONT Previously thought to have applied to Reyes:
2 CONT
2 CONT Reyes Chaves, "New Mexico, Births and Christenings, 1726-1918"
2 CONT *name:	 Reyes Chaves
2 CONT *gender:	 Male
2 CONT *baptism/christening date:	 01 May 1859
2 CONT *baptism/christening place:	 San Felipe, Albuquerque, Bernalillo, New Mexico
2 CONT *birth date:	 26 Apr 1859
2 CONT *father's name:	Jose Chaves
2 CONT *mother's name:	Vi... Sisneros
2 CONT *indexing project (batch) number:	C39028-1
2 CONT *system origin:	 New Mexico-EASy
2 CONT *source film number:	 16637
2 CONT
2 CONT "New Mexico, Births and Christenings, 1726-1918," index, FamilySearch (https://familysearch.org/pal:/MM9.1.1/FDNC-7XR : accessed 09 Feb 2013), Reyes Chaves, 26 Apr 1859; citing reference , FHL microfilm 16637.
2 CONT
2 CONT Between 1853 and 1861, under the direction of Padre Joseph Machebeuf (appointed by Bishop Jean-Baptiste Lamy), the Iglesia San Felipe de Neri was renovated to include the present two spires seen today. By 1859, many of the church'
2 CONC s renovations should have been completed.
2 CONT
2 CONT Vi Sisneros is actually an incomplete rendering of her first name, alternate spelling of her last name would be Cisneros.
2 CONT
