1 CONC before coming to reside at México City in the neighborhood of San Sebastián. Among the prominent citizens of Oaxaca in the sixteenth century were members of the Pérez de Zamora family. Members of this family went by these intercha
1 CONC ngable surnames: Zamora, Pérez, Pérez de Zamora, and González. 
